integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.source:
Some files already exist in the InkSim extension folder. Files listed for replacement may contain user changes. Other listed files will be preserved and never deleted.

Files to replace:
{replace_files}

Files to preserve:
{preserve_files}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.translation:
Faylal qaarkood ayaa hore ugu jira galka kordhinta InkSim. Faylasha loo taxay in la beddelo waxaa laga yaabaa inay ku jiraan isbeddello uu isticmaaluhu sameeyey. Faylasha kale ee la taxay waa la ilaalin doonaa, waligoodna lama tirtiri doono.

Faylasha la beddelayo:
{replace_files}

Faylasha la ilaalinayo:
{preserve_files}

Ma sii wadaysaa?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.source:
The listed user extension folders and all files inside them will be permanently deleted. The current install/update target and system extension folders will not be removed.

{directories}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.translation:
Galalka kordhinta isticmaalaha ee la taxay iyo dhammaan faylasha ku jira si joogto ah ayaa loo tirtiri doonaa. Meesha rakibidda/cusboonaysiinta ee hadda iyo galalka kordhinta nidaamka lama tirtiri doono.

{directories}

Ma sii wadaysaa?
